\\ -2 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-58 & 136\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535005 true] [17592186326252 1000 #edb/ref 17592186326253 13194139535005 true] [17592186326252 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535005 true] [17592186326252 1041 "field-1" 13194139535005 true] [17592186326252 1104 #edb/ref 17592186326253 13194139535005 true] [17592186326252 1110 #uuid "cfe55f9b-5f6e-571e-ba5e-3ad49dada07b" 13194139535005 true] [17592186326253 1034 "-58" 13194139535005 true] [17592186326253 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535005 true] [17592186326253 1111 #uuid "6940fca4-92f2-5cba-9deb-f531c54a0aa1" 13194139535005 true] [17592186326254 1000 #edb/ref 17592186326255 13194139535005 true] [17592186326254 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535005 true] [17592186326254 1041 "field-2" 13194139535005 true] [17592186326254 1104 #edb/ref 17592186326255 13194139535005 true] [17592186326254 1110 #uuid "59faf82c-5de7-5533-adad-187c159602df" 13194139535005 true] [17592186326255 1034 "136" 13194139535005 true] [17592186326255 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535005 true] [17592186326255 1111 #uuid "7947acc9-7664-52a2-bd7e-8922f97e9f2c" 13194139535005 true] [17592186326256 1017 #edb/ref 17592186326257 13194139535005 true] [17592186326256 1089 "q-42267" 13194139535005 true] [17592186326256 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535005 true] [17592186326256 1100 "Given that $A,B,$ and $C$ are $5\\times 5$ matrices, and  ${I}_{5}$ is the $5\\times 5$ identity matrix, which of the following statements are always true?\n\n- $AB=BA$\n- $A(B+C)=AB+AC$\n- $B{I}_{5}={I}_{5}B$" 13194139535005 true] [17592186326256 1113 #uuid "be6e8e19-7022-5ded-a9f9-f8652f73cf31" 13194139535005 true] [17592186326256 1145 "Let's consider the statements one by one.\n\n- Statement I is false. Matrix multiplication is not commutative, so $AB\\ne BA$ in general.\n\n- Statement II is true. Matrix multiplication is distributive, so $(A+B)C=AC+BC,$ and $A(B+C)=AB+AC$ in general.\n\n- St